{
  "_note": "Badhon's World publishes no category for its products. These SHAGORBENZ categories are assigned from keywords in the TITLE (first matching rule wins, case-insensitive). Edit freely; unmatched products go to 'Other'. The supplier category stays empty — it is never guessed.",
